WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:02.473
Let's count down the best Snoopy

00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:04.809
summertime moments from Season Three.

00:00:05.393 --> 00:00:08.354
Number eight, sandy simple pleasures.

00:00:08.521 --> 00:00:09.647
My grandpa always says,

00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:11.357
when it comes to simple pleasures,

00:00:11.357 --> 00:00:13.359
nothing beats a sandcastle.

00:00:22.869 --> 00:00:24.370
Except the tide.

00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:28.041
Number seven, settle in for a staycation.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:31.586
I'm glad you decided to stay home for a change, Snoopy.

00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:36.174
After all, there's more to life than sitting around drinking root beer.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.554
Oui, monsieur.

00:00:42.847 --> 00:00:46.601
Number six, beware of picnic pirates.

00:00:54.525 --> 00:00:56.402
(Gasp)

00:01:01.324 --> 00:01:04.535
Number five, remember to stay hydrated.

00:01:15.505 --> 00:01:18.883
(Gulps)

00:01:20.134 --> 00:01:23.304
Number four, Snoopy keeps his cool.

00:01:23.304 --> 00:01:23.846
Snoopy.

00:01:24.097 --> 00:01:25.973
I like you as much as the next person.

00:01:27.809 --> 00:01:30.395
That's why I feel so comfortable asking you to...

00:01:30.395 --> 00:01:33.189
please get your dog house outta my pool!

00:01:40.863 --> 00:01:42.198
Thanks, Snoopy.

00:01:42.198 --> 00:01:44.575
(Popping noise)

00:01:45.993 --> 00:01:49.038
Number three, Snoopy catches a game.

00:01:50.331 --> 00:01:51.582
All yours Snoopy.

00:01:54.961 --> 00:01:56.170
(Shouting)

00:01:56.170 --> 00:02:00.675
Number two, time for a bird and beagle bath.

00:02:04.804 --> 00:02:06.097
(Sighs)

00:02:14.647 --> 00:02:18.025
(Excited squeals)

00:02:22.363 --> 00:02:24.198
(Excited squeals)

00:02:24.198 --> 00:02:26.993
And number one, ice cream strategies.

00:02:26.993 --> 00:02:28.453
Now, I ask you, Charlie Brown,

00:02:29.078 --> 00:02:32.665
is there a more delicious puzzle to solve on a hot summer's day,

00:02:32.665 --> 00:02:35.918
than how to properly eat an ice cream cone?

00:02:37.003 --> 00:02:39.881
For instance, there's the "Chomper".

00:02:43.301 --> 00:02:44.719
Brain freeze!

00:02:46.679 --> 00:02:48.765
That method is not without its risks.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.769
Here's another, the "Side Swiper".

00:02:54.187 --> 00:02:55.104
Rats!

00:02:55.772 --> 00:02:56.898
Also has a downside.

00:02:58.524 --> 00:02:59.692
What do you call that?

00:03:03.738 --> 00:03:05.114
A complete mess.

